{"steam_appid":4140530,"steam_name":"The Plant Shop","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4140530/1443100573/cec79df23808e8800a2381411e3e0e88d29ae64a/1763728787/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765267116","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257235809/86e9b9993aaef7aaa1bff7c8617bc09c4615035a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765267116","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140530/5b3c8d252b3c8f760f53141463b8dd26889ca90e/ss_5b3c8d252b3c8f760f53141463b8dd26889ca90e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790247732","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140530/b74e9170fc274686cfbefc134ce63204b4dfffc8/ss_b74e9170fc274686cfbefc134ce63204b4dfffc8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790247732","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140530/9ece585da4c13b8085f352c0082cafeafa2ec7da/ss_9ece585da4c13b8085f352c0082cafeafa2ec7da.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790247732","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140530/9d24f17883e970ef77571fde2e4e1893e4f8833e/ss_9d24f17883e970ef77571fde2e4e1893e4f8833e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790247732","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140530/2087530a93b6f2142d2ad7773c96cd06745e2fe3/ss_2087530a93b6f2142d2ad7773c96cd06745e2fe3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790247732"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Plant Shop</strong> is a cozy horror game where you manage a small plant shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft plants, serve late-night customers and grow your plant collection to attract more people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140530/extras/6a2fafd03b35bdb4ef55c03daaa595d5.webp?t=1790247732\" width=640 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140530/extras/94b5e8f885808b7d4e2d96106afe97a8.poster.avif?t=1790247732\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140530/extras/94b5e8f885808b7d4e2d96106afe97a8.webm?t=1790247732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Silvia, a 26 years old girl who decides to open her own small plant shop on a late-night shift because she has a corporate job during the day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140530/extras/78f043b3db5a8795ccaa52e311ffb4be.webp?t=1790247732\" width=640 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140530/extras/301724db770958e1acd12c38163965e6.poster.avif?t=1790247732\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140530/extras/301724db770958e1acd12c38163965e6.webm?t=1790247732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is to serve the customers coming to the shop. Depending on the order you will have to craft flowers, plants or cacti.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140530/extras/cf85163b1424ad9ab21e75051cbf484a.webp?t=1790247732\" width=640 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140530/extras/4ddeb9df78b81e98901f8a07f0c58edd.poster.avif?t=1790247732\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140530/extras/4ddeb9df78b81e98901f8a07f0c58edd.webm?t=1790247732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting plants is easy. You just need a plant pot, soil, a seed and water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140530/extras/50df7909073448ab43e8f8e03402e038.webp?t=1790247732\" width=640 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140530/extras/27881c40fbc83a5222d5149b5d834b8a.poster.avif?t=1790247732\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140530/extras/27881c40fbc83a5222d5149b5d834b8a.webm?t=1790247732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The customers talk about a curse that struck the town 30 years ago. As you manage your shop, you begin to see and hear strange things. <i>Is the curse real—or just an old legend?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong> Narrative walking simulator with a simple game loop: take orders from customers, craft plants and serve them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VHS film aesthetics:</strong> Emulates the look of old CRT screens that adds an eerie atmosphere.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Story:</strong> Experience Silvia’s journey and uncover the truth about The Plant Shop and the strange events happening in town.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME MODES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode:</strong> Follow Silvia's dream of having a successful Plant Shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxed Mode:</strong> Manage your own cozy Plant Shop at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode (with leaderboard)</strong>: Fulfill orders against the clock and try to survive as long as possible.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOR CONTENT CREATORS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to create content from the game and monetize the gameplay by any means.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.6 GHz or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 750ti or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.2 GHz or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 950 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Casual","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["Tori"],"publishers":["Tori"],"release_date":"Sep 16, 2026"}